  "changed": [
    "Schedule schema2 binds owned-record-processing-schedule-v1 and the complete exact approved task. Source owned_released_records selects only current authorized released actor-owned revisions with the exact source-policy hash,accepted/published before due. Schema1 hashes and delivery/collection meaning remain unchanged.",
    "Calendar admission stages ordinary run,processing intent,membership,input claim,events and receipt atomically. Processing uses the existing16-intent queue;delivery admission remains separate. Current task/independent review/output contract/credentials/calendar/deadline guards remain live. Native SQL defaults preserve legacy clauses;new intent-transition guards and Go current inspection enforce schedule authority with calendar-before-namespace lock ordering.",
    "API and CLI wire the existing processor. CLI running attempts keep their original keys;only recorded failure advances within the existing three attempts. Completed outputs wait for separate checks/release. Browser reviews full task rules and opens occurrence runs in ordinary session-bound processing controls;pending exact-key commands are preserved. Processing calendar journal payloads/receipts remain private behind exact original digests.",
    "Source58 adds functions and a trigger only;metadata77/forced-RLS76. Historical57/56/other explicit profiles and retained35 remain unchanged."
  ],
